# Greasefang's beginning-of-combat trigger targets a Vehicle card in its controller's own graveyard only: Bot2's
# Smuggler's Copter and Bot1's own Bloodforged Battle-Axe (an artifact that is no Vehicle) are in graveyards too and are
# refused, while two Vehicles of Bot1's are candidates, so the target is asked. The Copter comes back with haste, and at
# the beginning of Bot1's end step returns to its owner's hand. Bot1's Duress puts Bot2's Copter in Bot2's graveyard;
# Bot2's three Duresses put Bot1's Copter, Reckoner Bankbuster and Axe in Bot1's.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Duress
Smuggler's Copter
Reckoner Bankbuster
Bloodforged Battle-Axe
Greasefang, Okiba Boss
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Smuggler's Copter
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Swamp
Duress
Duress
Duress
Swamp x15

